.TH ELF_GET_SECTION 3
.SH NAME
elf_get_section \- find a section by name
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <elf.h>
.P
.BI "void* elf_get_section(void* " elf ", const char* " name ", size_t* " szp ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR elf_get_section ()
finds the section with the given
.I name
within the ELF file
.IR elf .
If
.I szp
is provided, it is updated with the size of the section.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a pointer to the section data, or NULL if not found.